WEBVTT

00:11.460 --> 00:15.210
Takatou-kun, you really should be
driving right now!

00:15.210 --> 00:19.420
Oh no, he's sound asleep...

00:19.420 --> 00:22.630
He's always asleep at times like this!

00:29.580 --> 00:31.670
How do you like "Yogiri"?

00:31.670 --> 00:33.630
Then, "Yogiri Takatou"?

00:34.460 --> 00:36.170
This is a handshake, okay?

00:36.170 --> 00:37.750
"Nice to meet you."

00:37.750 --> 00:39.330
Now, you say it!

00:39.330 --> 00:41.170
Nice to meet you...

02:16.960 --> 02:18.580
<b>Final Interview Site</b>

02:19.710 --> 02:21.580
So this boils down to

02:21.580 --> 02:25.290
"Even if I die on the job
I will not complain," correct?

02:21.580 --> 02:23.460
<b>Mutual Confirmation and Agreement for Period of Employment</b>

02:25.630 --> 02:27.830
You're a quick one!

02:27.830 --> 02:29.290
May I leave now?

02:30.460 --> 02:32.630
I can't possibly send you home, now can I?

02:33.330 --> 02:35.250
<b>Asaka Takatou</b>

02:33.330 --> 02:35.250
<b>Signature</b>

02:34.210 --> 02:35.290
Is this...

02:35.290 --> 02:38.210
a secret base of an evil organization?

02:38.750 --> 02:39.710
Of course not!

02:39.710 --> 02:42.960
We are a respectable facility
that conducts experiments

02:42.960 --> 02:44.790
for the people of our society.

02:46.000 --> 02:48.290
What do you want me to do?

02:48.920 --> 02:52.380
To put it simply,
take care of the monster.

02:52.380 --> 02:53.330
What?!

02:53.830 --> 02:57.210
<b>Independent Higher Order</b>

02:53.830 --> 02:57.210
<b>Life Form Research Institute</b>

02:54.130 --> 02:56.710
We're doing cursed experimentations here.

03:00.290 --> 03:01.750
What is this?!

03:02.960 --> 03:04.710
A scripture.

03:04.710 --> 03:10.710
It's for consolation,
and this works for some people as well.

03:10.880 --> 03:13.210
Where are we headed?

03:13.210 --> 03:15.460
To your workplace.

03:16.830 --> 03:20.380
Do you know the term "Alpha Omega"?

03:20.380 --> 03:22.500
How could I possibly?

03:23.830 --> 03:26.380
It's the beginning and the end of the
Grecian alphabet.

03:26.380 --> 03:29.880
In other words,
it means "everything" or "eternity."

03:30.250 --> 03:33.880
It's the code name of the test subject
you'll be taking care of.

03:33.880 --> 03:37.250
The test subject you speak of
is a human, right?

03:37.250 --> 03:41.460
I've never seen it,
so that's impossible for me to say.

03:43.080 --> 03:45.420
What I know as of now
is that simply by thinking it,

03:45.420 --> 03:49.380
Alpha Omega can kill anything he wants to.

03:49.380 --> 03:50.290
Pardon me?

03:50.290 --> 03:53.080
And you want me to take care of
a monster like that...

03:53.080 --> 03:56.380
You have your teacher's license, right?

03:56.380 --> 03:59.670
Huh? You mean that's why?

03:59.670 --> 04:01.080
If this situation were to continue,

04:01.080 --> 04:04.380
there's a possibility
that humanity will perish.

04:04.380 --> 04:05.130
What?

04:05.130 --> 04:10.130
By giving him an adequate education,
I suspect we can avoid that.

04:10.130 --> 04:12.630
But why am I doing this?!

04:12.630 --> 04:15.580
There are so many other people
more suitable for this sort of thing.

04:15.580 --> 04:18.170
There were entries, and you fit just fine.

04:18.170 --> 04:21.330
That is way too arbitrary!

04:26.000 --> 04:29.290
I don't have clearance
to go any further than this.

04:29.290 --> 04:30.210
Huh?

04:30.420 --> 04:33.790
Everything you'll need
will be written in the instructions.

04:33.790 --> 04:35.000
Wait...

04:35.580 --> 04:38.290
Well, take it easy and good luck!

04:44.750 --> 04:46.040
<b>Independent Higher Order</b>

04:44.750 --> 04:46.040
<b>Life Form Research Institute</b>

04:50.040 --> 04:51.580
Ugh, gosh!

04:51.580 --> 04:54.290
Won't be my fault when humanity
gets decimated!

05:04.460 --> 05:07.040
I'm underground now, right?

05:08.750 --> 05:11.000
<b>Premises Rough Sketch</b>

05:08.750 --> 05:11.000
<b>Work location</b>

05:08.750 --> 05:11.000
<b>(and housing)</b>

05:08.750 --> 05:11.000
<b>Entrance</b>

05:11.920 --> 05:13.500
Hello?

05:14.000 --> 05:16.250
Anyone there?

05:17.000 --> 05:18.580
Hello?

05:21.210 --> 05:22.670
Hey...

05:36.420 --> 05:38.040
How ridiculous!

05:38.330 --> 05:40.540
Locking a kid like this away underground!

05:40.540 --> 05:42.580
What is there to be afraid of?!

05:42.580 --> 05:44.130
And this goes for you too!

05:44.130 --> 05:47.130
You're just gonna
obediently stay locked up?!

05:51.830 --> 05:53.960
Now you're outside! Go play!

05:53.960 --> 05:57.580
Catch yourself a crawfish or
a tadpole shrimp and go play!

05:57.580 --> 05:59.290
C'mon, stand up!
What're you doing?!

05:59.290 --> 06:00.290
Play!

06:02.250 --> 06:04.580
Uh, am I gonna die?!

06:08.040 --> 06:11.380
Looks like it got here
by hiding in your shadow, Miss.

06:11.380 --> 06:12.670
But what is that?

06:13.210 --> 06:15.130
Something like a devil, I think.

06:15.130 --> 06:18.460
They come here
and try to kill me sometimes.

06:18.460 --> 06:21.040
Uh, they do?

06:21.670 --> 06:24.250
Um, I don't mind playing,

06:24.250 --> 06:27.630
but it'll be evening soon
so can I do that tomorrow?

06:27.630 --> 06:28.460
Huh?

06:28.460 --> 06:32.830
Ah, I'm sorry!
I just kinda lost my mind there!

06:33.210 --> 06:34.210
Here.

06:36.540 --> 06:39.790
I'm Asaka Takatou.

06:39.790 --> 06:40.710
Who are you?

06:40.710 --> 06:43.000
They call me Alpha Omega.

06:43.000 --> 06:46.670
Uh, no, that's a code name.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.380
What's your name?

06:48.380 --> 06:52.630
Before I came here,
they called me Lord Okakushi...

06:52.630 --> 06:55.080
But more importantly, I'm hungry.

06:56.830 --> 06:58.920
I'm hungry too...

06:58.920 --> 07:01.290
Wait, am I supposed to cook?!

07:08.040 --> 07:09.960
Nope! No can do!

07:14.460 --> 07:17.880
But I gotta make something
before he's done...

07:24.380 --> 07:25.460
What's this?

07:25.460 --> 07:28.290
Just go ahead and eat it.

07:33.040 --> 07:34.210
It's yummy.

07:34.210 --> 07:36.540
I've never tasted anything
like this before.

07:36.540 --> 07:38.000
Let's see...

07:38.000 --> 07:39.960
We can start with a name.

07:40.330 --> 07:42.750
What did your mom or whoever call you?

07:43.130 --> 07:44.500
My mom?

07:44.960 --> 07:47.000
Ah, nevermind.

07:47.000 --> 07:49.670
I'll just pick something, is that okay?

07:49.670 --> 07:50.710
Yeah!

08:00.920 --> 08:03.000
How do you like "Yogiri"?

08:03.000 --> 08:05.130
Then, "Yogiri Takatou"?

08:05.130 --> 08:07.920
Why'd you take on my last name?!

08:08.210 --> 08:11.540
Don't you put that kind of thing
after your first name?

08:11.710 --> 08:14.500
When did we become family?

08:14.500 --> 08:17.580
But... I guess you don't know
that either, huh?

08:20.210 --> 08:24.420
Okay, from now on you are Yogiri Takatou.

08:24.420 --> 08:25.580
Nice to meet you.

08:31.460 --> 08:33.130
This is a handshake.

08:33.500 --> 08:35.080
"Nice to meet you."

08:35.080 --> 08:36.960
Now, you say it!

08:36.960 --> 08:38.420
Nice to meet you...

08:42.170 --> 08:43.960
Nice to meet you...

08:43.960 --> 08:46.420
Takatou-kun, wake up!

08:46.420 --> 08:48.580
Hm? What?

08:48.580 --> 08:49.830
We're at a dead end!

08:51.540 --> 08:54.750
And you slept really well
on this mountain path, huh?

08:54.750 --> 08:59.130
I used a huge amount of my ability
in Hanabusa, so I'm pooped.

08:59.130 --> 09:01.460
Hey! Don't go back to sleep!

09:01.460 --> 09:03.920
Oh dear,
even the Dannoura school of driving

09:03.920 --> 09:07.040
can't compete with things
crumbling here and there like this!

09:07.250 --> 09:10.210
Oh? Oh? Oh, really?
That's not the slightest bit helpful<b>
</b>right now, now is it?!<b></b>

09:10.630 --> 09:15.130
By the way, why was it
that we have to go to the royal captial?

09:15.130 --> 09:16.380
You're asking that now?!

09:16.380 --> 09:18.830
Couldn't you have asked that
before we left?!

09:18.830 --> 09:22.630
Our goal is to return
to the world we were in.

09:22.630 --> 09:26.830
And, in order to do that I want
to get in contact with Sion the Sage.

09:26.830 --> 09:28.290
However, if that's all we want,

09:28.290 --> 09:31.710
then there may be another way
of doing so without going to the capital.

09:31.710 --> 09:35.250
But it looks like all of
our classmates are going there.

09:35.250 --> 09:36.210
Hmm.

09:36.210 --> 09:40.000
It seems best to go back a little bit
and find another route for now.

09:40.000 --> 09:41.710
Yes, obviously.

09:42.500 --> 09:44.960
Huh?! Something's there!

09:48.540 --> 09:50.040
That's a dragon, huh...

09:52.080 --> 09:53.000
Die.

09:59.830 --> 10:01.210
Takatou-kun, over there!

10:02.790 --> 10:04.790
A whole lot of 'em are heading this way!

10:05.420 --> 10:07.880
Feels like we're defintely
in enemy territory.

10:11.040 --> 10:11.880
Crap!

10:11.880 --> 10:14.460
They're coming at us with fire this time!

10:14.460 --> 10:15.710
In that case...

10:15.710 --> 10:17.170
All of you, die.

10:19.130 --> 10:23.170
Ugh, this looks like
a bug spray commercial...

10:24.500 --> 10:26.460
What is up with this all of a sudden...

10:26.460 --> 10:28.460
If this is the dragon's territory,

10:28.460 --> 10:31.080
then we're also at fault
for unknowingly entering.

10:32.630 --> 10:33.880
That one's ginormous!

10:33.880 --> 10:37.500
A golden thunder dragon type thing
is coming for us!

10:53.960 --> 10:55.130
We're so screwed!

10:55.130 --> 10:57.420
It's totally dead set
on letting loose some lightning!

10:57.420 --> 11:00.250
No, I don't feel any hostility from it.

11:01.290 --> 11:03.750
Maybe it's just looking this way?

11:04.750 --> 11:06.170
You pass.

11:07.460 --> 11:08.380
Huh?

11:08.380 --> 11:11.130
I'm not too sure,
but looks like it's leaving.

11:11.130 --> 11:12.130
Wait!

11:12.130 --> 11:12.960
Huh?!

11:12.960 --> 11:15.630
Since you can understand me,
I won't let you leave!

11:15.630 --> 11:16.580
Stop!

11:16.580 --> 11:19.670
Otherwise you'll meet the same fate
as the other dragons!

11:20.460 --> 11:22.540
It can fly without flapping its wings?!

11:25.790 --> 11:28.630
If only I'd flown away quietly...

11:29.290 --> 11:33.330
Why did that Golden Thunder Dragon
from before turn into a girl?!

11:33.330 --> 11:36.250
It happens a lot in isekai worlds.

11:36.250 --> 11:38.580
Why did you attack us?

11:38.580 --> 11:42.540
I wanted to test out if you were qualified
to see the Swordmaster-sama.

11:42.540 --> 11:45.210
Swordmaster... what was that again?

11:45.210 --> 11:49.290
Didn't you all come here
to see the Swordmaster?!

11:49.290 --> 11:52.250
No, we just wanted
to go to the royal capital.

11:54.790 --> 11:58.080
The Swordmaster is here in this gorge.

11:58.080 --> 12:00.580
He will bestow the Gift.

12:00.580 --> 12:03.830
If that's what this is about,
then it has nothing to do with us.

12:05.040 --> 12:06.080
For real.

12:06.080 --> 12:06.920
Let's go.

12:07.920 --> 12:09.630
Please!

12:09.630 --> 12:13.290
He told me to bring him
some promising candidates!

12:13.290 --> 12:15.880
I'm not interested either though.

12:15.880 --> 12:19.460
Swordmaster is one who rivals a Sage!

12:19.630 --> 12:20.960
A Sage?

12:20.960 --> 12:22.420
If that's true,

12:22.420 --> 12:26.210
then he might have information
about how to go back to our world.

12:26.210 --> 12:30.170
But we can't afford to take a detour
when we're already lost...

12:30.170 --> 12:32.170
You've lost your way?!

12:32.500 --> 12:34.130
Okay, I know what to do!

12:34.130 --> 12:36.130
I'll show you where to go!

12:36.380 --> 12:37.920
If you meet with the Swordmaster,

12:37.920 --> 12:40.080
I'll bring you all the way
to the royal capital!

12:41.670 --> 12:44.540
I'm Atila! Nice to meetcha!

12:45.630 --> 12:49.790
Atila, Atila,
the Swordmaster's over there-a!

12:55.290 --> 12:56.540
We're here.

12:58.290 --> 13:00.500
There are a whole lot of people here...

13:00.710 --> 13:01.960
Who the hell are those guys?

13:01.960 --> 13:04.460
You can get here by car?!

13:04.460 --> 13:08.170
Everyone here is a swordsman who's
aiming to become the next Swordmaster,

13:08.170 --> 13:11.250
and today we're choosing
the next Knight of the Divine King.

13:11.250 --> 13:13.920
Are you trying to drag us into
some sort of trouble?

13:13.920 --> 13:17.330
Nice job getting here,
but you losers are disqualified!

13:17.330 --> 13:21.080
We haven't started yet,
so there's nothing to disqualify anyone.

13:22.130 --> 13:24.880
Well, if you can't even make it here,

13:22.130 --> 13:27.540
<b>Swordmaster Urabe</b>

13:24.880 --> 13:27.290
then you've got bigger problems
than this trial.

13:27.790 --> 13:29.330
Wow! It's the Swordmaster!

13:29.880 --> 13:31.540
There's a lot of you...

13:31.710 --> 13:32.630
All right!

13:32.630 --> 13:35.040
Start killing each other until I say stop!

13:35.040 --> 13:36.130
What?

13:36.580 --> 13:40.170
If there aren't less than half of you left
ten minutes from now,

13:40.170 --> 13:41.830
then everyone fails!

13:42.250 --> 13:44.710
I don't care about being disqualified
so can I leave?

13:44.710 --> 13:46.040
What'd you say?!

13:47.210 --> 13:51.000
Then if anyone escapes from this place,
everyone fails!

13:51.000 --> 13:52.960
WHAT?

13:52.960 --> 13:54.960
C'mon, get to it!

13:58.750 --> 13:59.630
Whoa!

14:01.000 --> 14:03.540
Mistress, you've gotten used
to this situation!

14:03.540 --> 14:07.170
At this point, it'll take more than this
to make me scream my head off.

14:11.080 --> 14:13.330
This has gotten to be a pain.

14:13.540 --> 14:15.080
Die!

14:15.750 --> 14:17.420
I guess I have to kill.

14:17.630 --> 14:19.330
I'll protect you!

14:22.960 --> 14:26.380
You folks don't understand
the intentions of the Swordmaster!

14:26.580 --> 14:30.330
This is a trial to ascertain if you
are able to take the appropriate actions

14:30.330 --> 14:32.500
as a Knight of the Divine!

14:32.500 --> 14:35.000
Looks like he's a
pretty decent guy, though...

14:35.000 --> 14:38.790
And it seems he's quite skilled, as well!

14:41.040 --> 14:43.000
This intent to kill...

14:43.000 --> 14:44.000
Die.

14:45.790 --> 14:47.130
What in the world was that?!

14:47.130 --> 14:49.830
Ah! Uh, well, you see...

14:49.830 --> 14:51.080
I get it!

14:51.210 --> 14:55.290
The Swordmaster punished
the insolent ruffians!

14:55.290 --> 14:56.670
Yeah that, maybe!

14:56.670 --> 14:59.750
I heard you happened
to just be passing by.

14:59.750 --> 15:01.080
It may be unfortunate for you,

15:01.080 --> 15:03.380
but would you mind joining me
for a while longer?

15:03.380 --> 15:04.540
Sure...

15:05.540 --> 15:07.290
Help me!

15:07.290 --> 15:10.380
G-get that stone...

15:10.380 --> 15:12.420
You were slain earlier!

15:12.420 --> 15:15.710
That rainbow colored stone...

15:15.710 --> 15:17.380
put it in my hand!

15:17.380 --> 15:18.210
Huh?!

15:18.210 --> 15:19.710
That one! Yeah!

15:19.710 --> 15:20.580
This?

15:23.170 --> 15:25.670
This is... an "Apology Stone"!

15:29.960 --> 15:31.130
What?!

15:31.130 --> 15:33.460
Gosh, you really saved me there!

15:33.460 --> 15:35.130
What just happened?!

15:35.130 --> 15:36.130
Stop!

15:36.130 --> 15:38.630
We're changing locations.
Come with me.

15:38.630 --> 15:39.790
What do we do?

15:39.790 --> 15:42.580
I need you to participate in the trial!

15:42.580 --> 15:45.330
You told us we just had to meet
the Swordmaster, didn't you?

15:45.330 --> 15:47.670
If you two become
Knights of the Divine King,

15:47.670 --> 15:49.960
I can become your follower.

15:49.960 --> 15:51.710
Please, I'm begging you!

15:52.380 --> 15:55.920
Well, we still haven't gathered
any info yet...

15:56.330 --> 15:59.380
This just keeps getting worse and worse...

16:01.460 --> 16:03.170
My apologies for the late introduction.

16:03.170 --> 16:04.830
My name is Rick.

16:05.210 --> 16:07.670
Or, that is what you can call me
while we're here.

16:07.670 --> 16:11.080
Why do you say it like
you're some incognito celebrity here?!

16:11.500 --> 16:13.710
I'm Lynel.

16:13.710 --> 16:16.710
I'm only here because a friend invited me.

16:16.710 --> 16:20.210
Rick-san, what is the Divine King?

16:20.210 --> 16:22.250
You really have no clue, huh?

16:22.630 --> 16:24.420
I'll tell you then.

16:25.420 --> 16:27.330
The Divine King is the one who handles

16:27.330 --> 16:30.540
the gods who have been sealed away,
or what we call "demons."

16:30.540 --> 16:32.420
A thousand years ago,

16:32.420 --> 16:35.130
the Dark God was sealed away
by the Divine King's very own hands.

16:35.830 --> 16:38.500
Is he a threat even though
he's been sealed away?

16:38.500 --> 16:39.540
Yes.

16:39.540 --> 16:41.330
In order to revive their master,

16:41.330 --> 16:45.170
the spawn of the Dark God are active
behind the scenes all over the land.

16:45.500 --> 16:49.580
So, Lynel, what was that stone you had?

16:50.460 --> 16:52.920
This is an item I received as an apology,

16:52.920 --> 16:54.500
and it can heal me from serious injury

16:54.500 --> 16:56.540
and I can try my luck
with a gacha pull and stuff.

16:56.540 --> 16:59.330
Who's apologizing?! And what for?!

16:59.330 --> 17:04.460
My luck has always been bad and
I've experienced all sorts of misfortune.

17:04.670 --> 17:08.000
Last time, I was made a sacrifice
of a mysterious organization...

17:08.000 --> 17:09.580
When I thought it was over for me,

17:09.580 --> 17:13.210
a goddess appeared
and I got an Apology Stone.

17:13.670 --> 17:15.330
This got way off topic!

17:16.080 --> 17:17.250
Are people's fates something
that gods or whoever can influence?

17:17.250 --> 17:18.540
Mm-hmm... Mm-hmm...
Are people's fates something<b>
</b>that gods or whoever can influence?<b></b>

17:18.540 --> 17:19.790
Are people's fates something
that gods or whoever can influence?

17:19.790 --> 17:21.330
Depends on the person.

17:21.330 --> 17:26.040
There are people like you who are
protected by guardian spirits after all.

17:26.040 --> 17:28.130
What's... a "gacha"?

17:28.130 --> 17:29.750
I get one pull with three stones,

17:29.750 --> 17:32.040
and with 30 stones
I get ten consecutive pulls.

17:32.040 --> 17:33.540
Want me to show you?

17:39.500 --> 17:41.000
It's a normal scrub brush!

17:41.000 --> 17:45.420
And that's how I can exchange them
for a random item!

17:45.420 --> 17:47.420
That's a bad pull though?

17:47.710 --> 17:51.420
Wait, don't you only have three left?

17:51.420 --> 17:52.460
At midnight,

17:52.460 --> 17:56.210
I get new Apology Stones depending
on the misfortunes I had that day.

17:59.080 --> 18:00.330
They disappeared?!

18:00.330 --> 18:02.290
'Cuz there's a barrier.

18:02.290 --> 18:04.330
Just keep going, don't worry about it.

18:13.880 --> 18:15.330
What in the world is this?!

18:15.330 --> 18:17.710
Oh no! Walk away, immediately!

18:17.710 --> 18:19.540
What's wrong, Mokomoko-san?!

18:19.540 --> 18:21.670
Do you not notice
this unpleasant misasma here?!

18:21.670 --> 18:24.170
Something sinister lies ahead of us!

18:26.750 --> 18:27.920
You okay?!

18:28.210 --> 18:30.130
The miasma's got him!

18:30.420 --> 18:32.580
I don't feel anything, though...

18:32.580 --> 18:34.830
I'm protecting you!

18:35.080 --> 18:40.540
It has no effect on me,
but it seems unbearable to Lynel-san.

18:44.000 --> 18:46.580
I got miasma resistance
from my Apology Stones.

18:46.580 --> 18:49.290
Is it really that easy to use?!

18:49.580 --> 18:51.420
You okay, Takatou-kun?

18:51.420 --> 18:52.380
Huh?!

18:52.380 --> 18:54.210
Uh... yeah...

18:56.830 --> 18:59.790
Hm? Uh, the miasma has dissipated.

18:59.790 --> 19:00.830
Really?

19:00.830 --> 19:03.790
Uh... huh? Where's Atila?

19:03.790 --> 19:05.880
She's not here.

19:05.880 --> 19:08.170
She may have been stopped by the barrier.

19:08.170 --> 19:11.540
There are only people undergoing
the trial from here forward.

19:15.710 --> 19:18.380
It's super spacious inside here...

19:18.380 --> 19:21.080
Hurry up and get in here!
You'll get left behind!

19:22.290 --> 19:23.790
An elevator?

19:24.330 --> 19:26.830
In this super fantasy-esque tower?

19:26.830 --> 19:29.080
I'm glad there aren't stairs.

19:36.130 --> 19:37.630
Come take a look.

19:40.790 --> 19:42.130
That can't be...

19:43.330 --> 19:46.130
This is the End of the World.

19:47.790 --> 19:49.290
Do you see anything?

19:49.670 --> 19:55.830
In the center of the solidified monster
is a man in black and a woman in white...

19:56.380 --> 20:00.500
It looks like they were frozen as
her sword went straight through them.

20:00.500 --> 20:02.790
That's the Swordmaster and the Dark God.

20:02.790 --> 20:03.750
Huh?!

20:03.750 --> 20:07.170
It comes as no surprise
that this world shall end one day.

20:07.170 --> 20:11.130
A Swordmaster amounts
to nothing more than a lookout.

20:11.130 --> 20:14.080
If we beat those guys
that'll solve everything, won't it?

20:15.580 --> 20:16.880
Frederica-san!

20:16.880 --> 20:17.960
You know her?

20:17.960 --> 20:20.920
She's the one who invited me here.

20:20.920 --> 20:24.290
I can't believe she came here with
the intention of defeating the Dark God.

20:24.500 --> 20:26.460
Self-confident, aren't we?

20:26.460 --> 20:29.380
Your duties are over as of today!

20:29.380 --> 20:32.170
I'll let you live
the rest of your life in peace.

20:32.710 --> 20:34.460
Sunburst...

20:35.250 --> 20:36.880
Flare!

20:41.500 --> 20:45.170
Now it's all over for the
Dark God and those spawn!

20:45.170 --> 20:46.130
What?!

20:52.290 --> 20:56.250
Time is flowing slowly inside the barrier.

20:56.460 --> 21:00.830
It may be several hundred years
before that attack reaches the Dark God.

21:03.670 --> 21:08.000
And so, the knight selection test
will now begin.

21:08.000 --> 21:10.420
She will give you the details.

21:10.710 --> 21:14.960
The goal is to go from
the roof to the first floor of this tower

21:14.960 --> 21:17.210
within 24 hours.

21:17.210 --> 21:21.920
Does that mean I'll fail if I jump
from here and land on the ground?

21:21.920 --> 21:25.630
Everyone must accumulate
one hundred points inside the tower.

21:27.040 --> 21:28.920
How tedious.

21:28.920 --> 21:30.750
Has she always been here?

21:30.750 --> 21:33.000
She wasn't with us on the ground.

21:33.290 --> 21:37.630
Several special participants
will be added here.

21:39.130 --> 21:42.250
Would you be able to beat them
with your ability, Takatou-kun?

21:42.250 --> 21:44.960
Oh yeah, you've got no reason
to kill them, right?

21:44.960 --> 21:46.790
I feel like that's what you'd say...

21:46.790 --> 21:48.710
Hey, Takatou-kun!

21:52.540 --> 21:53.790
What's wrong?

21:54.330 --> 21:58.830
Well... back when that miasma
was really bad...

21:59.380 --> 22:00.500
Actually...

22:03.830 --> 22:05.330
WHAT?!

23:37.080 --> 23:41.000
<b>"I'm Not So Rude as to Complain After Being Saved"</b>

23:37.750 --> 23:40.920
"I'm Not So Rude
as to Complain After Being Saved"
